    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Tonia L",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117125854768634162797/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKl2iYZvtPMoOsGD0XFDYSK1-fq5ak_dzT8k0j3hug-8000qg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Andy and Terry are super professional and the best in the business! They did my parents roof and now mine. We are all super pleased with the work done! They did a great job at cleaning up after the work was done. They are easy to work with. Super friendly. Price is affordable and they keep you in the loop every step of the way. I couldn’t recommend them enough!",
        "time": 1748985803,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "M N",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110013016796784963437/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ_3aFW5PZvk4zTn7URrAm16V01nc9IC_esRmrTqmoKIsw4QeI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Hired Andy and Terry to remove a leaking skylight which was original to our mid 90's home. First spoke to Andy in the winter regarding the removal and accepted his quote. He told me he would reach out to me in April to get it done which he did, contacting me on the 3rd of April.  Terry (partner) showed up right on time on the 4th - blown away by their follow up which is rare these days. What a great team - fair price, good communication right from the start, and job well done. They left the place like they found it - very good after job cleanup. We couldn't be happier and will be using them when the time comes to replace the roof shingels in a couple of years. Very highly recommended.",
        "time": 1743879036,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Emily Turner",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113232878607296969156/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXllYC7_-bMtlzBRww1fShQrLeERnuRUCWkipi2qHGYP_WHaUkuyQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Andy and Terry are the best in the business. They preformed a large job recently on our large challenging home. We previously had many quotes from competitors. Not only did Roofstarr beat the other quotes they stayed true and precise to their quote. Their roofing shows meticulous workmanship. They care about their jobs and it shows visually and through their pleasant personalities. Their crew was in the best of spirits even on the hottest week of summer. Always on time, working nonstop to get the job done, and with positive energy. Never complaining and working through and through. Don't waste your time looking elsewhere. This is a team you can count on for a beautiful job whether it be a small repair or huge undertaking. Thank you for all your hard work! It is deeply appreciated! It was a stressfree experience, and we are pleased with your work!!",
        "time": 1720399437,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Genevieve Marie L",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100606515763454930292/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9lsJ--7CO9AfelviBCMMdICoXgBHpy5vojzUm-Md9TqmvzCNF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend this roofing company because they were punctual and took great care with worker safety and cleanliness, ensuring the area around our home was left just as they found it. The team was very respectful, professional and went above and beyond by taking extra steps to secure everything around the new roofing. I'm glad I trusted my instincts and chose them for the job. Thank you!",
        "time": 1721949553,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Paul Darvasi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106579679638064492891/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWeV42wj5S9jcADp7_LUnjSAggcoK9ia9RoIpeJnHoIni6n5RLFYQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Sometimes we find magic in unexpected places. We moved to Saint-Lazare from Toronto and had to quickly change the roof on our new home. I did my homework, and decided on Roofstarr for a combination of price, willingness to do the job quickly, and reputation in the community. Happy to report that they exceeded my expectations. Andy is a consummate professional, and his crew are not only pleasant and smiling, but relentless hard workers who take pride in their trade. We have a tough roof with lots of peaks, valleys, and hard corners. Rather than grumble and complain, they shared how they tackled each challenge with smiles and pride in their work to let us know that we would have a sturdy roof over our heads for years to come. They were punctual, fast, and left the site immaculate. I have rarely been more satisfied by a service in any sector, and am now convinced that roofing can be elevated to the status of art. Bravo!",
        "time": 1620407092,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
